  << /ActualText (11\0572023 \055 03\0572026\n3D Artist \055 Hibari Vietnam\nWorked in a professional Japanese 3D animation production pipeline\054 contributing to 3D modelling\054 BG\057asset production\054 layout\054 basic animation\054 rendering\054 and visual consistency\056\nCreated and refined 3D layouts\054 camera compositions\054 spatial relationships\054 and environments based on storyboards and production requirements\056\nWorked with 3ds Max and other 3D\057Adobe tools throughout production\054 coordinating visual requirements across multiple stages of the workflow\056\nApplied texturing\054 lighting\054 composition\054 and post\055production techniques to support the intended visual style and final output\056\nCollaborated within a structured production environment and adapted assets and scenes based on feedback and technical requirements\056\n\n\n2023 \055 2024\n2D \046 3D Designer \055 Freelance\n2D\072 Handled Magazine Layouts\056\n3D\072 Executed the full pipeline including Modeling\054 Sculpting\054 Painting\057Texturing\054 Rigging\054 Animation\054 and Layout\054 adapting to diverse client requirements\056)
